# Build output. Without this, `COPY . .` drags a locally-restored obj/ into the
# image and overwrites the restore the build stage just did for the target
# architecture, failing with:
#   NETSDK1047: Assets file doesn't have a target for 'net8.0/linux-arm64'
obj/
bin/

# Test project: not needed at runtime, and it references xunit which the
# runtime image does not have.
tests/

.vs/
*.user
